**Put your photos in folders, run Revela, and get a finished website** that you can publish anywhere. Runs on Windows, macOS and Linux.

[[gallery]]

## Why Revela?

**Built for photographers.** Other website builders are made for blogs and online shops. Revela focuses on one thing: **showing your photos beautifully**.

<div class="features-grid">

### 📁 Your folders are your website
Each folder of photos becomes a gallery. Add, change or remove photos and build again; Revela only redoes what changed.

### ⚡ Fast for every visitor
Revela prepares each photo in several sizes and modern formats, so phones and big screens both get the smallest file that still looks perfect.

### 🎨 Beautiful out of the box
A clean, minimal theme that puts your photos first, with dark mode. Change colors and layout whenever you like.

### 🌍 Publish anywhere
The result is plain website files. Host them for free on GitHub Pages, Netlify or Cloudflare Pages, or on any web space.

### 📦 One download, nothing else
No installer, no account, no subscription, no database. Unzip and start.

</div>

## Noticeably faster

**Your images load in 0.2 seconds, not 3.** No loading spinner, no bounce. And because Revela produces lean, static pages, search engines rank you higher and every visitor sees your work instantly.

> **Proof:** [photo.kirk.one](https://photo.kirk.one) scores **100 / 100 / 100 / 100** on Google Lighthouse (Performance · Accessibility · Best Practices · SEO) — First Contentful Paint 0.2 s, zero layout shift.

